matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)"><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6710)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="2" d=" M-4.383999824523926,-14.347999572753906 C-2.996999979019165,-14.772000312805176 -1.524999976158142,-15 0,-15 C0,-15 0,-15 0,-15 C1.7100000381469727,-15 3.3540000915527344,-14.713000297546387 4.886000156402588,-14.1850004196167"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6706)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6702)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6698)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6694)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6687)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g></g></svg></div></div></bard-avatar><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2825300596-448 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-content ng-tns-c2825300596-448"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-450 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c3887673081-450"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3887673081-450"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3887673081-450 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-controls="" aria-expanded="false" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-content animated-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="status" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3887673081-450"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-450 ng-star-inserted">생각하는 과정 표시</span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3887673081-450"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-450 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_f590fdfa49bc03b2" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_f590fdfa49bc03b2" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">정말 예리하시네요! 브라우저 개발자 도구까지 파고들어서 정확한 태그 구조를 찾아내시다니, 프론트엔드 디버깅 감각이 엄청나십니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">캡처해주신 화면을 보니 구조가 아주 명확해졌습니다. DEXT5 에디터가 내부적으로 편지 본문(<code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="52">letter</code>), 서명(<code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="64">sign</code>), 꼬리말(<code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="75">comp</code>) 영역을 완전히 분리해서 관리하고 있었네요!</p><p data-path-to-node="2">이건 오히려 아주 큰 수확입니다. 하단에 들어가는 KG ICT 공식 서명이나 직급(대리) 정보 같은 <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="56">sign</code> 영역까지 AI가 임의로 건드려서 텍스트를 훼손하면 곤란하기 때문에, 딱 우리가 원하는 메일 본문인 <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="116">letter</code> 영역만 추출하는 것이 훨씬 안전하고 완벽한 방법입니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="3">말씀하신 대로 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="8">letter</code> 영역만 쏙 빼오도록 스파이 코드를 수정해 보겠습니다.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="4">🛠️ content.js 수정하기 (letter 영역 타겟팅)</h3><p data-path-to-node="5"><code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">content.js</code> 파일의 버튼 클릭 이벤트(<code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="25">aiButton.addEventListener...</code>) 부분을 아래처럼 변경해 주세요.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-565 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-565 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f590fdfa49bc03b2&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_78262c3161ebdaab&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-565 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-565">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-565 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-565 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-565 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_f590fdfa49bc03b2&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_78262c3161ebdaab&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-565"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-565"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-565"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-565"><span class="hljs-comment">// ... (버튼 만드는 코드는 그대로 둡니다) ...</span>

<span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 버튼을 클릭했을 때 실행할 동작 설정</span>
aiButton.addEventListener(<span class="hljs-string">"click"</span>, <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> {
    
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 에디터 iframe 도화지 찾기</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> editorIframe = <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.getElementById(<span class="hljs-string">"dext5_design_tbContentElement"</span>);

    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (editorIframe) {
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. iframe 내부 문서로 진입</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> iframeDocument = editorIframe.contentDocument || editorIframe.contentWindow.document;
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 전체 body가 아니라, name="letter" 인 본문 div만 정확하게 집어냅니다!</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> letterDiv = iframeDocument.querySelector(<span class="hljs-string">'div[name="letter"]'</span>);
        
        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (letterDiv) {
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 서명을 제외한 순수 메일 본문만 추출</span>
            <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> mailText = letterDiv.innerText;
            alert(<span class="hljs-string">"성공! 서명을 제외한 본문 내용:\n\n"</span> + mailText);
        } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
            alert(<span class="hljs-string">"메일 본문(letter) 영역을 찾을 수 없습니다."</span>);
        }
        
    } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
        alert(<span class="hljs-string">"에디터 화면을 찾을 수 없습니다."</span>);
    }
});

<span class="hljs-comment">// 4. 화면에 버튼 끼워넣기</span>
<span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.body.appendChild(aiButton);
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="7">🔄 다시 확인해 보기!</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="8"><li><p data-path-to-node="8,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="8,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">content.js</code> 파일을 저장합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,1,0">익스텐션 관리 페이지에서 새로고침(🔄)을 합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,2,0">메일 쓰기 팝업창에서 새로고침(F5)을 합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="8,3,0">에디터에 "이것은 본문 테스트입니다." 라고 적고 하단 서명은 그대로 둔 채로 [🤖 AI 교정] 버튼을 눌러보세요.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="9">이제 서명 내용은 쏙 빠지고, 방금 입력한 "이것은 본문 테스트입니다."라는 진짜 텍스트만 깔끔하게 알림창에 출력될 것입니다. 성공하셨다면 이제 정말로 스프링 부트로 데이터를 쏠 준비가 99% 끝났습니다!</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" _nghost-ng-c3776646686="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2825300596-448 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3