<stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></lineargradient><lineargradient id="__lottie_element_6800" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></lineargradient><lineargradient id="__lottie_element_6804" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></lineargradient><lineargradient id="__lottie_element_6808" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></lineargradient><lineargradient id="__lottie_element_6812" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop><stop></stop></lineargradient><lineargradient id="__lottie_element_6816" spreadMethod="pad" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x1="-16" y1="0" x2="16" y2="0"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="50%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="rgb(49,134,255)"></stop></lineargradient></defs><g clip-path="url(#__lottie_element_6789)"><g transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,16,16)" opacity="1" style="display: block;"><g opacity="1" transform="matrix(1,0,0,1,0,0)"><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6816)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4" stroke-opacity="1" stroke-width="2" d=" M-4.383999824523926,-14.347999572753906 C-2.996999979019165,-14.772000312805176 -1.524999976158142,-15 0,-15 C0,-15 0,-15 0,-15 C1.7100000381469727,-15 3.3540000915527344,-14.713000297546387 4.886000156402588,-14.1850004196167"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6812)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6808)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6804)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6800)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_6793)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g></g></svg></div></div></bard-avatar><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2825300596-455"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-content ng-tns-c2825300596-455"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-container ng-star-inserted"><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_6ba035fc3967c0a5" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_6ba035fc3967c0a5" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">음, 알려주신 모든 요소(<code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="14">hiddenSource</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="28">hiddenText</code>, <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="40">editorIframe</code>)가 전부 <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="58">null</code>로 나온다면 상황이 조금 다릅니다. 이 경우는 보안 문제(CORS)나 <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="101">all_frames</code>의 문제가 아니라, <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="122">진짜로 그 요소들을 찾을 수 없는 상태</b>입니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">가장 흔한 두 가지 원인과 확실한 해결책을 제시해 드립니다!</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><h3 data-path-to-node="3">🕵️‍♂️ 원인 1: iframe의 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="21">id</code>가 동적으로 변한다 (매번 바뀜)</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">DEXT5 같은 상용 에디터는 페이지를 새로고침할 때마다 <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="32">iframe</code>의 ID를 살짝씩 바꾸는 경우가 많습니다.
예를 들어 아까는 <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="72">dext5_design_tbContentElement</code> 였지만, 지금 켜보면 <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="114">dext5_design_editor1</code> 이나 다른 이름으로 바뀌어 있을 수 있습니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="5"><b data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">[해결책]</b>
에디터 화면에서 다시 마우스 우클릭 -&gt; [검사]를 누르고 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="39">iframe</code> 태그를 확인해 보세요. ID가 아까와 다르게 변했나요? 만약 변한다면, 고정된 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="90">class</code>나 <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="97">title</code> 속성을 사용해서 찾아야 합니다.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="6">🕵️‍♂️ 원인 2: "늦게 그려지는" 에디터 (타이밍 문제의 극대화)</h3><p data-path-to-node="7">사실 이 원인일 확률이 99%입니다!</p><p data-path-to-node="8">메일 팝업창(HTML)이 화면에 다 그려지고 나서 우리 익스텐션 스크립트가 실행되는데, <b data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="49">DEXT5 에디터는 그보다 훨씬 나중에(1~3초 뒤에) 자바스크립트로 천천히 <code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="92">iframe</code>을 만들어냅니다.</b></p><p data-path-to-node="9">즉, 익스텐션이 버튼을 만들면서 에디터를 찾으려고 할 때는 "아직 에디터가 화면에 존재하지 않는 상태"였기 때문에 전부 <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="67">null</code>이 나온 것입니다.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="10">🛠️ 확실한 해결책: content.js "버튼 누를 때" 찾기</h3><p data-path-to-node="11">해결 방법은 간단합니다! 익스텐션이 켜지자마자 에디터를 찾는 게 아니라, <b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="41">사용자가 에디터에 글을 다 쓰고 파란색 [🤖 AI 교정] 버튼을 "클릭"하는 그 순간에 에디터를 찾도록</b> 코드를 바꿔주면 됩니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="12"><code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="0">content.js</code>의 코드를 아래와 같이 다시 한번만 수정해 주세요. (로직을 클릭 이벤트 <code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="51">안쪽</code>으로 완전히 밀어 넣고, 찾는 방식도 유연하게 바꿨습니다.)</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-568 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-568 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6ba035fc3967c0a5&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_bae84522a0c2a874&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="4" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-568 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-568">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-568 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-568 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-568 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6ba035fc3967c0a5&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_bae84522a0c2a874&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-568"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-568"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-568"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-568"><span class="hljs-built_in">console</span>.log(<span class="hljs-string">"🚀 AI 메일 어시스턴트: 크롬 익스텐션 로딩 완료!"</span>);

<span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 버튼 먼저 예쁘게 만듭니다.</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> aiButton = <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.createElement(<span class="hljs-string">"button"</span>);
aiButton.innerHTML = <span class="hljs-string">"🤖 AI 교정"</span>;
aiButton.style.position = <span class="hljs-string">"fixed"</span>;
aiButton.style.bottom = <span class="hljs-string">"30px"</span>;
aiButton.style.right = <span class="hljs-string">"30px"</span>;
aiButton.style.padding = <span class="hljs-string">"15px 20px"</span>;
aiButton.style.backgroundColor = <span class="hljs-string">"#0056b3"</span>;
aiButton.style.color = <span class="hljs-string">"white"</span>;
aiButton.style.border = <span class="hljs-string">"none"</span>;
aiButton.style.borderRadius = <span class="hljs-string">"50px"</span>;
aiButton.style.boxShadow = <span class="hljs-string">"0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)"</span>;
aiButton.style.fontSize = <span class="hljs-string">"16px"</span>;
aiButton.style.fontWeight = <span class="hljs-string">"bold"</span>;
aiButton.style.cursor = <span class="hljs-string">"pointer"</span>;
aiButton.style.zIndex = <span class="hljs-string">"9999"</span>;

<span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 버튼을 화면에 무조건 먼저 붙여둡니다.</span>
<span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.body.appendChild(aiButton);

<span class="hljs-comment">// 3. ✨ 버튼을 "클릭" 했을 때 비로소 에디터를 찾기 시작합니다! ✨</span>
aiButton.addEventListener(<span class="hljs-string">"click"</span>, <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> {
    
    <span class="hljs-built_in">console</span>.log(<span class="hljs-string">"버튼 클릭됨! 에디터 탐색 시작..."</span>);

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 방법 A: title 속성으로 찾기 (ID가 변해도 찾을 수 있습니다)</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">// iframe 태그에 있던 title="편집 모드 영역..." 을 활용합니다.</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> editorIframe = <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.querySelector(<span class="hljs-string">'iframe[title*="편집 모드 영역"]'</span>);
    
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 방법 B: 만약 title로도 못 찾으면 기존 ID로 한 번 더 시도합니다.</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> fallbackIframe = <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.getElementById(<span class="hljs-string">"dext5_design_tbContentElement"</span>);

    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> targetIframe = editorIframe || fallbackIframe;

    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (targetIframe) {
        <span class="hljs-built_in">console</span>.log(<span class="hljs-string">"성공! iframe을 찾았습니다:"</span>, targetIframe);
        
        <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> {
            <span class="hljs-comment">// iframe 속으로 진입</span>
            <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> iframeDoc = targetIframe.contentDocument || targetIframe.contentWindow.document;
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// name="letter" 찾기</span>
            <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> letterDiv = iframeDoc.querySelector(<span class="hljs-string">'div[name="letter"]'</span>);
            
            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (letterDiv) {
                <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> mailText = letterDiv.innerText;
                alert(<span class="hljs-string">"🎉 데이터 추출 성공!\n\n"</span> + mailText);
            } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
                alert(<span class="hljs-string">"iframe은 찾았지만, 'letter' 영역을 찾을 수 없습니다."</span>);
            }
        } <span class="hljs-keyword">catch</span> (error) {
            alert(<span class="hljs-string">"iframe 접근 권한 오류(CORS). manifest.json에 all_frames 옵션이 켜져 있는지 확인하세요."</span>);
        }

    } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
        alert(<span class="hljs-string">"아직도 에디터(iframe)를 찾을 수 없습니다. (에디터 로딩 지연 또는 구조 변경)"</span>);
    }
});
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="14">위 코드로 변경하시고, 익스텐션 새로고침(<code data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="23">🔄</code>) -&gt; 팝업창 새로고침(<code data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="39">F5</code>) 후 다시 버튼을 눌러보세요!
이번에는 버튼을 누르는 시점에 에디터가 100% 로딩되어 있을 테니 무조건 찾을 수 있을 겁니다!</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-footer complete gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" _nghost-ng-c3776646686="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2825300596-455 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3779276655="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-456 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c2825300596-455 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-456"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-456 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" _nghost-ng-c870918567="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-456 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c870918567="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="대답이 마음에 들어요" aria-label="대답이 마음에 들어요" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-pressed="false" jslog="173913;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_6ba035fc3967c0a5&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_bae84522a0c2a874&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-