081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-460 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_30297a67ebee9d1b" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_30297a67ebee9d1b" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">정확합니다! 소스 코드를 완전히 꿰뚫어 보셨네요.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">개발자님이 찾아내신 그 <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="13">&lt;div name="letter"&gt;</code> 부분이 에디터가 본문 텍스트만 고스란히 담아두는 '진짜 핵심 코어'입니다. 거기를 찌르는 게 100% 정답입니다!</p><p data-path-to-node="2">그런데 이전 코드들에서 <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="13">null</code>이 나왔던 진짜 이유는, <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="31">크롬 브라우저의 강력한 '보안 정책(CORS)'</b> 때문이었습니다.
파란색 버튼이 있는 '바깥쪽 창'에서, 에디터가 있는 '안쪽 창(iframe)'으로 손을 뻗어서 글씨를 강제로 빼오려고 하니 브라우저가 "남의 창을 훔쳐보지 마!" 하고 차단해 버린 것입니다.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">💡 완벽한 해결책: 무전기(postMessage) 기법 사용하기</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">이럴 때는 아주 우아한 스파이 작전을 써야 합니다.</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="5"><li><p data-path-to-node="5,0,0">버튼을 누르면 바깥 창에서 안쪽 창(iframe)으로 <b data-path-to-node="5,0,0" data-index-in-node="30">"본문 좀 넘겨줘!"</b> 하고 무전(Message)을 칩니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="5,1,0">안쪽 창에 숨어있는 우리 스파이 코드가 개발자님이 찾으신 <code data-path-to-node="5,1,0" data-index-in-node="32">div[name="letter"]</code>를 싹 긁어서 바깥으로 던져줍니다!</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="6">아래 코드로 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="7">content.js</code>를 수정하시면 <b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="25">보안 차단을 완벽하게 우회</b>할 수 있습니다.</p><hr data-path-to-node="7"><h3 data-path-to-node="8">🛠️ content.js 최종본 (무전 통신 방식)</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">기존 <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="3">content.js</code> 내용을 싹 지우고 아래 코드로 붙여넣어 주세요!</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-569 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-569 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_30297a67ebee9d1b&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_50677566569add17&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-569 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-569">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-569 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-569 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-569 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_30297a67ebee9d1b&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_50677566569add17&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-569"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-569"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-569"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-569"><span class="hljs-comment">// 내가 현재 위치한 곳이 '바깥쪽 메인 창'인지, '에디터 안쪽(iframe)'인지 구분합니다.</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> isIframe = <span class="hljs-built_in">window</span> !== <span class="hljs-built_in">window</span>.top;

<span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!isIframe) {
    <span class="hljs-comment">// ==========================================</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">// [바깥쪽 메인 창] : 버튼을 띄우고 무전을 치는 역할</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">// ==========================================</span>
    <span class="hljs-built_in">console</span>.log(<span class="hljs-string">"🚀 메인 창: AI 버튼 생성 완료"</span>);

    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> aiButton = <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.createElement(<span class="hljs-string">"button"</span>);
    aiButton.innerHTML = <span class="hljs-string">"🤖 AI 교정"</span>;
    aiButton.style.position = <span class="hljs-string">"fixed"</span>;
    aiButton.style.bottom = <span class="hljs-string">"30px"</span>;
    aiButton.style.right = <span class="hljs-string">"30px"</span>;
    aiButton.style.padding = <span class="hljs-string">"15px 20px"</span>;
    aiButton.style.backgroundColor = <span class="hljs-string">"#0056b3"</span>;
    aiButton.style.color = <span class="hljs-string">"white"</span>;
    aiButton.style.border = <span class="hljs-string">"none"</span>;
    aiButton.style.borderRadius = <span class="hljs-string">"50px"</span>;
    aiButton.style.boxShadow = <span class="hljs-string">"0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)"</span>;
    aiButton.style.fontSize = <span class="hljs-string">"16px"</span>;
    aiButton.style.fontWeight = <span class="hljs-string">"bold"</span>;
    aiButton.style.cursor = <span class="hljs-string">"pointer"</span>;
    aiButton.style.zIndex = <span class="hljs-string">"9999"</span>;
    <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.body.appendChild(aiButton);

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 버튼을 클릭하면 모든 iframe에게 "GET_LETTER" 무전을 보냅니다.</span>
    aiButton.addEventListener(<span class="hljs-string">"click"</span>, <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> {
        <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> frames = <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.querySelectorAll(<span class="hljs-string">"iframe"</span>);
        frames.forEach(<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-params">frame</span> =&gt;</span> {
            frame.contentWindow.postMessage({ <span class="hljs-attr">type</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"GET_LETTER"</span> }, <span class="hljs-string">"*"</span>);
        });
    });

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 에디터 안쪽에서 "RETURN_LETTER" 무전(본문 데이터)이 오면 받아서 띄웁니다.</span>
    <span class="hljs-built_in">window</span>.addEventListener(<span class="hljs-string">"message"</span>, <span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">event</span>) =&gt;</span> {
        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (event.data &amp;&amp; event.data.type === <span class="hljs-string">"RETURN_LETTER"</span>) {
            alert(<span class="hljs-string">"🎉 완벽하게 추출했습니다!\n\n"</span> + event.data.text);
        }
    });

} <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
    <span class="hljs-comment">// ==========================================</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">// [안쪽 에디터 창] : 무전을 기다리다 letter를 찾아 던지는 역할</span>
    <span class="hljs-comment">// ==========================================</span>
    
    <span class="hljs-built_in">window</span>.addEventListener(<span class="hljs-string">"message"</span>, <span class="hljs-function">(<span class="hljs-params">event</span>) =&gt;</span> {
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 바깥에서 "GET_LETTER" 지시가 떨어지면 동작합니다.</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (event.data &amp;&amp; event.data.type === <span class="hljs-string">"GET_LETTER"</span>) {
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 개발자님이 직접 찾아내신 그 핵심 태그를 찌릅니다!</span>
            <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> letterDiv = <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.querySelector(<span class="hljs-string">'div[name="letter"]'</span>);
            
            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (letterDiv) {
                <span class="hljs-comment">// 서명을 제외한 본문 내용만 빼서 바깥쪽(메인 창)으로 휙 던져줍니다.</span>
                <span class="hljs-built_in">window</span>.top.postMessage({ 
                    <span class="hljs-attr">type</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"RETURN_LETTER"</span>, 
                    <span class="hljs-attr">text</span>: letterDiv.innerText 
                }, <span class="hljs-string">"*"</span>);
            }
        }
    });
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="11"><i data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="0">(주의: 이전 단계에서 <code data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="13">manifest.json</code>에 추가했던 <code data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="33">"all_frames": true</code> 옵션이 꼭 있어야 안쪽 에디터 창에서도 코드가 동작합니다!)</i></p><h3 data-path-to-node="12">🔄 다시 확인해 보기!</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="13"><li><p data-path-to-node="13,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="13,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">content.js</code>를 저장합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,1,0">확장 프로그램 관리 페이지(<code data-path-to-node="13,1,0" data-index-in-node="15">chrome://extensions/</code>)에서 새로고침(🔄)을 누릅니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,2,0">그룹웨어 메일 쓰기 팝업창에서 새로고침(F5)을 합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,3,0">에디터에 대충 텍스트를 적고 파란색 버튼을 눌러보세요.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="14">이번엔 틀림없이 알림창에 서명을 제외한 순수한 본문 데이터만 쏙 뽑혀서 출력될 것입니다! 결과 확인되시면 알려주세요!</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" _nghost-ng-c