><g><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_7005)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g></g></svg></div></div></bard-avatar><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2825300596-470 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-content ng-tns-c2825300596-470"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-472 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c3887673081-472"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3887673081-472"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3887673081-472 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-controls="" aria-expanded="false" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-content animated-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="status" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3887673081-472"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-472 ng-star-inserted">생각하는 과정 표시</span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3887673081-472"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-472 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_cf1bc127132a7e07" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_cf1bc127132a7e07" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">아, 정말 끈질긴 녀석(DEXT5 에디터)이네요! 스파이 스크립트 투하 방식까지 막히다니, 그룹웨어 보안이 생각보다 훨씬 강하게 설정되어 있거나 에디터 버전의 특성 때문인 것 같습니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">하지만 여기서 포기할 수 없죠. 크롬 익스텐션(Manifest V3)이 가진 '진짜 마스터 키'를 꺼낼 때가 왔습니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">지금까지 계속 안 됐던 근본적인 이유는 크롬 익스텐션이 "격리된 세계(Isolated World)"에서 돌고 있었기 때문입니다. 아무리 발버둥 쳐도 사내 그룹웨어의 진짜 메모리(DOM)에는 닿을 수 없었던 거죠.</p><p data-path-to-node="3">하지만 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="4">manifest.json</code>에 단 한 줄만 추가하면, 익스텐션의 코드를 격리 구역이 아니라 <b data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="53">사내 그룹웨어와 완전히 동일한 본체(Main World)</b> 안으로 집어넣을 수 있습니다!</p><p data-path-to-node="4">이번엔 100% 될 수밖에 없는 구조입니다. 딱 두 파일만 마지막으로 수정해 보겠습니다!</p><hr data-path-to-node="5"><h3 data-path-to-node="6">🔑 1. manifest.json 수정 (마스터 키 추가)</h3><p data-path-to-node="7"><code data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="0">manifest.json</code> 파일에 <code data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="18">"world": "MAIN"</code> 이라는 엄청난 권한을 추가해 줍니다.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-598 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-598 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_cf1bc127132a7e07&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4cbdb643f6e444e9&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-598 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-598">JSON</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-598 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-598 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-sy