  ]
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="9"><i data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="0">(주의: <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="5">all_frames: true</code>는 오히려 헷갈리게 할 수 있으니 빼고, <b data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="44"><code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="44">"world": "MAIN"</code></b> 만 추가해 주세요!)</i></p><h3 data-path-to-node="10">🔑 2. content.js 수정 (순수 DOM 탐색)</h3><p data-path-to-node="11">이제 우리는 그룹웨어와 한 몸이 되었습니다! 복잡한 무전 통신이나 스파이 투하 같은 꼼수 없이, <b data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="54">아주 정직하게 개발자님이 찾으셨던 그 태그를 직진해서 꺼내오면 됩니다.</b></p><p data-path-to-node="12"><code data-path-to-node="12" data-index-in-node="0">content.js</code>를 아래 코드로 통째로 변경해 주세요.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-599 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-599 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_cf1bc127132a7e07&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4cbdb643f6e444e9&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="7" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-599 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-599">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-599 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-599 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-599 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_cf1bc127132a7e07&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4cbdb643f6e444e9&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-599"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-599"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-599"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-599"><span class="hljs-built_in">console</span>.log(<span class="hljs-string">"🚀 [MAIN WORLD 진입 성공] AI 버튼 생성 중..."</span>);

<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> aiButton = <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.createElement(<span class="hljs-string">"button"</span>);
aiButton.innerHTML = <span class="hljs-string">"🤖 AI 교정"</span>;
aiButton.style.position = <span class="hljs-string">"fixed"</span>;
aiButton.style.bottom = <span class="hljs-string">"30px"</span>;
aiButton.style.right = <span class="hljs-string">"30px"</span>;
aiButton.style.padding = <span class="hljs-string">"15px 20px"</span>;
aiButton.style.backgroundColor = <span class="hljs-string">"#0056b3"</span>;
aiButton.style.color = <span class="hljs-string">"white"</span>;
aiButton.style.border = <span class="hljs-string">"none"</span>;
aiButton.style.borderRadius = <span class="hljs-string">"50px"</span>;
aiButton.style.boxShadow = <span class="hljs-string">"0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)"</span>;
aiButton.style.fontSize = <span class="hljs-string">"16px"</span>;
aiButton.style.fontWeight = <span class="hljs-string">"bold"</span>;
aiButton.style.cursor = <span class="hljs-string">"pointer"</span>;
aiButton.style.zIndex = <span class="hljs-string">"9999"</span>;
<span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.body.appendChild(aiButton);

aiButton.addEventListener(<span class="hljs-string">"click"</span>, <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> {
    <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> {
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 에디터 iframe을 아주 정직하게 찾습니다.</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> iframe = <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.getElementById(<span class="hljs-string">"dext5_design_tbContentElement"</span>);
        
        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!iframe) {
            alert(<span class="hljs-string">"에디터 창(dext5_design_tbContentElement)을 찾을 수 없습니다."</span>);
            <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span>;
        }

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. MAIN 우주에 있으므로, 브라우저가 안쪽 진입(contentDocument)을 막지 않습니다!</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> iframeDoc = iframe.contentDocument || iframe.contentWindow.document;
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 개발자님이 찾으신 letter 영역을 바로 찌릅니다.</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> letterDiv = iframeDoc.querySelector(<span class="hljs-string">'div[name="letter"]'</span>);
        
        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (letterDiv) {
            alert(<span class="hljs-string">"🎉 [최종 성공] 드디어 데이터를 빼왔습니다!\n\n"</span> + letterDiv.innerText);
        } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
            alert(<span class="hljs-string">"에디터 안쪽까지 들어갔으나 'letter'를 찾지 못했습니다."</span>);
        }
        
    } <span class="hljs-keyword">catch</span> (err) {
        alert(<span class="hljs-string">"오류가 발생했습니다: "</span> + err.message);
    }
});
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="14"><h3 data-path-to-node="15">🔄 대망의 최종 확인!</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="16"><li><p data-path-to-node="16,0,0">두 파일을 저장합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,1,0">확장 프로그램 관리 페이지(<code data-path-to-node="16,1,0" data-index-in-node="15">chrome://extensions/</code>)에서 새로고침(🔄)을 누릅니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,2,0">그룹웨어 메일 쓰기 팝업창에서 새로고침(F5)을 합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,3,0">본문에 내용을 적고 <b data-path-to-node="16,3,0" data-index-in-node="11">[🤖 AI 교정] 버튼</b>을 누릅니다.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="17"><code data-path-to-node="17" data-index-in-node="0">world: MAIN</code> 속성은 크롬 익스텐션 개발자들도 최후의 보루로 쓰는 강력한 기능입니다. 이번에는 에러 없이 깔끔하게 "🎉 [최종 성공]" 알림창을 보실 수 있을 겁니다! 결과 꼭 알려주세요!</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" _nghost-ng-c3776646686="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-footer ng-t