div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-487 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c3887673081-487"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3887673081-487"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3887673081-487 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-controls="" aria-expanded="false" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-content animated-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="status" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3887673081-487"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-487 ng-star-inserted">생각하는 과정 표시</span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3887673081-487"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-487 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_26a3dfb75cd622fc" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_26a3dfb75cd622fc" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">그렇다면 가장 정석적이고 테스트하기 편한 순서대로, 데이터를 받을 스프링 부트(Spring Boot) 서버 쪽의 API(우편함)를 먼저 만들어 보겠습니다!</p><p data-path-to-node="1">서버가 켜져 있어야 익스텐션에서 데이터를 던졌을 때 정상적으로 받아지는지 바로 로그로 확인할 수 있거든요.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">현재 IntelliJ에서 작업 중이신 <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="21">prj_mailAssistant</code> 프로젝트를 열어주세요. Java 17 버전을 사용하시니, 최신 문법인 <code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="78">record</code>를 활용해 아주 깔끔하게 컨트롤러를 만들어 보겠습니다.</p><hr data-path-to-node="3"><h3 data-path-to-node="4">🛠️ Step 1. 데이터를 받을 DTO 만들기</h3><p data-path-to-node="5">익스텐션에서 보내주는 메일 본문 데이터를 예쁘게 담을 바구니(DTO)를 하나 만듭니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="6"><code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">MailRequest.java</code> (또는 원하시는 패키지 경로에 생성)</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-602 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-602 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_26a3dfb75cd622fc&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b98939dfb2436227&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-602 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-602">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-602 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-602 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-602 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_26a3dfb75cd622fc&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b98939dfb2436227&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-602"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-602"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-602"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-602"><span class="hljs-keyword">package</span> com.example.mailassistant.dto; <span class="hljs-comment">// 본인의 패키지 경로에 맞게 수정하세요</span>

<span class="hljs-comment">// Java 17의 record를 사용하면 불필요한 Getter/Setter 없이 깔끔하게 DTO 생성 가능합니다.</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> record <span class="hljs-title">MailRequest</span><span class="hljs-params">(String text)</span> </span>{
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="8">🛠️ Step 2. API 컨트롤러 만들기</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">익스텐션이 데이터를 던질 목적지 URL(<code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="22">POST /api/mail/correct</code>)을 만듭니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="10"><code data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="0">MailApiController.java</code></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-603 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-603 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_26a3dfb75cd622fc&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b98939dfb2436227&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="7" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-603 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-603">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-603 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-603 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-603 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_26a3dfb75cd622fc&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_b98939dfb2436227&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-603"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-603"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-603"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-603"><span class="hljs-keyword">package</span> com.example.mailassistant.controller; <span class="hljs-comment">// 본인의 패키지 경로에 맞게 수정하세요</span>

<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> com.example.mailassistant.dto.MailRequest;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.http.ResponseEntity;
<span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.*;

<span class="hljs-meta">@RestController</span>
<span class="hljs-meta">@RequestMapping("/api/mail")</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">// 🚨 핵심: 사내 그룹웨어(gw.kggroup.co.kr)에서 내 로컬 서버로 접근할 수 있도록 CORS를 허용해 줍니다.</span>
<span class="hljs-meta">@CrossOrigin(origins = "https://gw.kggroup.co.kr")</span> 
<span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> <span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">class</span> <span class="hljs-title">MailApiController</span> </span>{

    <span class="hljs-meta">@PostMapping("/correct")</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> ResponseEntity&lt;String&gt; <span class="hljs-title">correctMail</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-meta">@RequestBody</span> MailRequest request)</span> </span>{
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 익스텐션에서 보낸 텍스트가 잘 도착했는지 콘솔에 출력해 봅니다.</span>
        System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"📬 [AI 서버] 익스텐션으로부터 메일 본문 도착!"</span>);
        System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"------------------------------------------------"</span>);
        System.out.println(request.text());
        System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"------------------------------------------------"</span>);

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 지금은 일단 AI 교정이 완료되었다 치고, 가짜 응답을 다시 익스텐션으로 돌려보냅니다.</span>
        String dummyResponse = <span class="hljs-string">"서버에서 성공적으로 받았습니다! (이곳에 나중에 AI가 교정한 텍스트가 들어갑니다.)"</span>;
        
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ResponseEntity.ok(dummyResponse);
    }
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="12"><h3 data-path-to-node="13">🚀 Step 3. 서버 실행 및 테스트 준비</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="14"><li><p data-path-to-node="14,0,0">코드를 작성하셨다면 <b data-path-to-node="14,0,0" data-index-in-node="11">스프링 부트 애플리케이션을 실행(Run)</b> 해 주세요.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="14,1,0">하단 콘솔 창에 <code data-path-to-node="14,1,0" data-index-in-node="9">Tomcat started on port(s): 8080</code> (기본 포트) 메시지가 뜨며 서버가 정상적으로 켜졌는지 확인합니다.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="15">스프링 부트 서버가 무사히 켜졌다면 말씀해 주세요!
이제 아까 만든 크롬 익스텐션(<code data-path-to-node="15" data-index-in-node="46">content.js</code>)에서 <code data-path-to-node="15" data-index-in-node="60">alert</code> 대신 이 서버(<code data-path-to-node="15" data-index-in-node="74">http://localhost:8080/api/mail/correct</code>)로 방금 뽑아낸 텍스트를 확 던져버리는 코드로 수정하겠습니다.</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" _nghost-ng-c3776646686="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2825300596-485 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3779276655="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-486 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c2825300596-485 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-486"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-486 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" _nghost-ng-c870918567="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-486 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c870918567="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="대답이 마음에 들어요" aria-label="대답이 마음에 들어요" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-pressed="false" jslog="173913;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_26a3