oughts" _nghost-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-491 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c3887673081-491"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3887673081-491"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3887673081-491 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-controls="" aria-expanded="false" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-content animated-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="status" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3887673081-491"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-491 ng-star-inserted">생각하는 과정 표시</span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3887673081-491"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-491 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_15df323cf48ba33c" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_15df323cf48ba33c" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">완벽합니다! 서버가 켜져서 데이터를 받을 준비가 끝났으니, 바로 크롬 익스텐션 코드를 수정해서 데이터를 쏴보겠습니다.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="1">🛠️ content.js 수정하기 (서버로 데이터 전송)</h3><p data-path-to-node="2"><code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="0">content.js</code> 파일을 열고, 맨 아래에 있는 버튼 클릭 이벤트(<code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="38">aiButton.addEventListener...</code>) 부분을 아래 코드로 싹 바꿔주세요.</p><p data-path-to-node="3"><i data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="0">(이전의 성공했던 불도저 탐색 함수 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="20">findLetterDiv</code> 부분은 그대로 두시면 됩니다!)</i></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-604 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-604 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_15df323cf48ba33c&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f5d58716adf009cb&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-604 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-604">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-604 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-604 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-604 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_15df323cf48ba33c&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f5d58716adf009cb&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-604"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-604"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-604"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-604"><span class="hljs-comment">// --- 3. 버튼 클릭 시 불도저 출발 및 서버 전송 ---</span>
aiButton.addEventListener(<span class="hljs-string">"click"</span>, <span class="hljs-keyword">async</span> () =&gt; {
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 에디터 본문 탐색</span>
    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> resultDiv = findLetterDiv(<span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>);

    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (resultDiv) {
        <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> mailText = resultDiv.innerText;

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 사용자에게 처리 중임을 알림 (버튼 텍스트 변경 및 비활성화)</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> originalBtnText = aiButton.innerHTML;
        aiButton.innerHTML = <span class="hljs-string">"⏳ AI 교정 중..."</span>;
        aiButton.disabled = <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>;
        aiButton.style.backgroundColor = <span class="hljs-string">"#6c757d"</span>; <span class="hljs-comment">// 회색으로 변경</span>

        <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> {
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. 내 로컬 스프링 부트 서버로 데이터를 쏩니다!</span>
            <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> response = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> fetch(<span class="hljs-string">"http://localhost:8080/api/mail/correct"</span>, {
                <span class="hljs-attr">method</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"POST"</span>,
                <span class="hljs-attr">headers</span>: {
                    <span class="hljs-string">"Content-Type"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"application/json"</span>,
                },
                <span class="hljs-comment">// JSON 형태로 변환해서 보냅니다. (스프링 부트의 MailRequest DTO의 'text' 변수명과 일치해야 함)</span>
                <span class="hljs-attr">body</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">JSON</span>.stringify({ <span class="hljs-attr">text</span>: mailText }) 
            });

            <span class="hljs-comment">// 4. 서버로부터 응답이 성공적으로 오면</span>
            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (response.ok) {
                <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> resultText = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> response.text();
                alert(<span class="hljs-string">"✅ 성공!\n\n"</span> + resultText);
            } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
                alert(<span class="hljs-string">"🚨 서버에서 에러가 발생했습니다. 상태 코드: "</span> + response.status);
            }

        } <span class="hljs-keyword">catch</span> (error) {
            alert(<span class="hljs-string">"🚨 서버 통신 실패! 스프링 부트가 켜져 있는지 확인해 주세요.\n(에러: "</span> + error.message + <span class="hljs-string">")"</span>);
        } <span class="hljs-keyword">finally</span> {
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 5. 작업이 끝나면 버튼을 다시 원래대로 복구합니다.</span>
            aiButton.innerHTML = originalBtnText;
            aiButton.disabled = <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>;
            aiButton.style.backgroundColor = <span class="hljs-string">"#0056b3"</span>;
        }

    } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
        alert(<span class="hljs-string">"🚨 본문(letter) 영역을 찾을 수 없습니다."</span>);
    }
});
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="5">🔄 대망의 연동 테스트!</h3><p data-path-to-node="6">자, 이제 프론트엔드(익스텐션)와 백엔드(스프링 부트)가 처음으로 통신을 하는 역사적인 순간입니다.</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">content.js</code> 저장 후, 익스텐션 관리 페이지에서 <b data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="31">새로고침(🔄)</b></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0">그룹웨어 메일 팝업창에서 <b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="14">새로고침(F5)</b></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,2,0">에디터 본문에 <b data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="8">"안녕하세요. 백종현 대리입니다. 테스트 데이터를 보냅니다."</b> 라고 적어봅니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">[🤖 AI 교정] 버튼</b>을 누릅니다!</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="8"><b data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="0">[두 가지 확인 포인트]</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="9"><li><p data-path-to-node="9,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">브라우저 화면:</b> 아까 스프링 부트에서 적어둔 가짜 응답 메시지("서버에서 성공적으로 받았습니다!...")가 알림창으로 잘 뜨나요?</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="9,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">IntelliJ 콘솔창:</b> (이게 제일 중요합니다!) IntelliJ 하단 Run 탭의 로그에
<code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="52">📬 [AI 서버] 익스텐션으로부터 메일 본문 도착!</code>
<code data-path-to-node="9,1,0" data-index-in-node="82">안녕하세요. 백종현 대리입니다. 테스트 데이터를 보냅니다.</code>
라는 글씨가 예쁘게 찍혔나요?</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="10">IntelliJ 로그에 글씨가 찍혔다면, 프론트-백엔드 연동이 완벽하게 뚫린 것입니다! 결과 확인 부탁드립니다!</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" _nghost-ng-c3776646686="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2825300596-489 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3779276655="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-490 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c2825300596-489 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-490"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-490 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" _nghost-ng-c870918567="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-490 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c870918567="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="대답이 마음에 들어요" aria-label="대답이 마음에 들어요" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-pressed="false" jslog="173913;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_15df323cf48ba33c&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_f5d58716adf009cb&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-per