t-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2825300596-513 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-content ng-tns-c2825300596-513"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-515 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c3887673081-515"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3887673081-515"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3887673081-515 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-controls="" aria-expanded="false" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-content animated-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="status" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3887673081-515"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-515 ng-star-inserted">생각하는 과정 표시</span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3887673081-515"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-515 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_8e092e0273ecb863" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_8e092e0273ecb863" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">아하! 최신 버전인 <code data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="11">llama3.1</code>을 이미 설치해 두셨군요!</p><p data-path-to-node="1">이름이 <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="4">llama3</code>와 <code data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="12">llama3.1</code>로 미세하게 달라서 Ollama가 새로운 모델인 줄 알고 새로 다운로드를 시도했던 것입니다. 게다가 3.1 버전이 훨씬 더 똑똑하고 성능이 좋으니 이걸 쓰는 게 무조건 이득입니다!</p><p data-path-to-node="2">이제 모든 퍼즐이 맞춰졌습니다. 딱 두 가지만 바꿔주시면 됩니다.</p><h3 data-path-to-node="3">🛠️ 1. 터미널에서 올바른 모델 실행하기</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">다운로드하던 창은 그대로 취소(<code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="17">Ctrl + C</code>)해 두시고, 터미널에 아래 명령어를 쳐서 <code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="49">llama3.1</code> 모델을 깨워줍니다.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!---->