</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="6"><i data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">(프롬프트가 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="7">&gt;&gt;&gt;</code> 모양으로 바뀌면 준비가 완료된 것입니다.)</i></p><h3 data-path-to-node="7">🛠️ 2. 스프링 부트 코드 수정하기</h3><p data-path-to-node="8">IntelliJ로 돌아가서 <code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="15">MailApiController.java</code> 파일에 있던 모델 이름 변수를 정확하게 <code data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="60">llama3.1</code>로 바꿔줍니다.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-609 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-609 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_8e092e0273ecb863&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_698abe618c0563d0&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="7" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-609 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-609">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-609 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104