_ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-609"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-609"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-609"><span class="hljs-comment">// AS-IS (수정 전)</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">final</span> String OLLAMA_MODEL = <span class="hljs-string">"llama3"</span>; 

<span class="hljs-comment">// TO-BE (수정 후)</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">private</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">final</span> String OLLAMA_MODEL = <span class="hljs-string">"llama3.1"</span>; 
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="10"><h3 data-path-to-node="11">🚀 대망의 풀-사이클 테스트!</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="12"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,0">스프링 부트 서버를 <b data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="11">재시작(Restart)</b> 합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,0">그룹웨어 메일 팝업창(프론트엔드)에서 F5 새로고침을 합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,2,0">에디터에 조금 막 쓴 것 같은 메일을 적어봅니다.
<i data-path-to-node="12,2,0" data-index-in-node="28">(예: "회의 자료 첨부함. 내일까지 검토해서 알려줘.")</i></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,3,0"><b data-path-to-node="12,3,0" data-index-in-node="0">[🤖 AI 교정]</b> 버튼을 누릅니다!</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="13">버튼을 누르면 PC 내부에서 <code data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="16">llama3.1</code>이 윙~ 하고 돌아가면서 문장을 정중하고 깔끔하게 다듬은 뒤, 에디터 화면에 마법처럼 덮어씌워 줄 것입니다!</p><p data-path-to-node="14">결과가 잘 나오는지 너무 기대되네요. 꼭 확인해 보세요!</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" _nghost-ng-c3776646686="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2825300596-513 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3779276655="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-514 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c2825300596-513 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-514"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-514 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" _nghost-ng-c870918567="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-514 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c870918567="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="대답이 마음에 들어요" aria-label="대답이 마음에 들어요" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-n