serted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" role="heading" aria-level="2" class="query-text gds-body-l query-text-animated collapsed" dir="ltr"><span _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-user-query-label">말씀하신 내용</span><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 아니 근데  난  <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 안녕하시구려 백종현이올시다  <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 라고 말했는데  <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 제목 : 반가운 소식 <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 아주 감사합니다. 회사의 새로운 프로젝트에 참여하게되어 매우 기뻐요.&nbsp; <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 이번 프로젝트는 고객 만족도를 높이고자 하는 중요한 목표입니다. <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 프로젝트 진행을 위한 사항들은 아래와 같습니다. <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 1.&nbsp; 작업 일정: 이번 달 15일까지 완료 <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 2.&nbsp; 업무 구분: 백준팀과 마크팀의 협력으로 동시에 처리 <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 부서장님, 팀원 여러분께 많은 협조와 도움 부탁드립니다. <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 감사합니다. <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 이렇게 답을 해주네 답은 해주긴 하는데 좀 이상한 것 같아 그리고 제목은 필요없어 내용만이야  <!----><!----><!----></p><!----></div><button _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" mat-icon-button="" aria-label="펼치기" mattooltip="텍스트 펼치기" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger expand-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="224552;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a5a45ab175c0252c&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,1]];mutable:true" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-187" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-bu