----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-content ng-tns-c2825300596-521"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-523 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c3887673081-523"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3887673081-523"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3887673081-523 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-controls="" aria-expanded="false" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-content animated-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="status" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3887673081-523"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-523 ng-star-inserted">생각하는 과정 표시</span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3887673081-523"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-523 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_5fe69b537ba29dc4" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_5fe69b537ba29dc4" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">아이고, Llama 3.1 녀석이 이번엔 '친절한 비서' 빙의를 해버렸네요! 🤦‍♂️</p><p data-path-to-node="1">"죄송합니다. ~작성했습니다." 같은 말을 덧붙이는 건, AI 모델이 기본적으로 "사람과 대화하는 챗봇(Assistant)"으로 훈련되어 있어서 자꾸 대답(리액션)을 하려고 하기 때문입니다. 게다가 "자네"라는 단어를 어떻게든 높임말로 바꾸려다 보니 엉뚱하게 "회원님"을 가져다 붙였네요.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">이런 챗봇의 자아를 완전히 없애고 "오직 번역기/교정기처럼 결과만 뱉는 기계"로 만들려면, 두 가지 옵션을 줘야 합니다.</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="3"><li><p data-path-to-node="3,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">시스템 프롬프트(System Prompt):</b> "너는 챗봇이 아니라 교정기계야" 라고 역할 박기</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="3,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="3,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">Temperature(온도) 낮추기:</b> 창의성을 0에 가깝게 낮춰서 헛소리(소설)를 차단하기</p></li></ol><h3 data-path-to-node="4">🛠️ 스프링 부트 컨트롤러 최종 튜닝 (자아 삭제 &amp; 온도 조절)</h3><p data-path-to-node="5"><code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">MailApiController.java</code> 코드를 아래와 같이 한 번 더 수정해 주세요. 이번엔 Ollama API의 숨겨진 설정(<code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="72">system</code>, <code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="80">options.temperature</code>)을 사용합니다!</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-611 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-611 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5fe69b537ba29dc4&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1fcdf2927a368a2a&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-611 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-611">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-611 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-611 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-611 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5fe69b537ba29dc4&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1fcdf2927a368a2a&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-611"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-611"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-611"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-611"><span class="hljs-comment">// ... 기존 코드 ...</span>

    <span class="hljs-meta">@PostMapping("/correct")</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> ResponseEntity&lt;String&gt; <span class="hljs-title">correctMail</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-meta">@RequestBody</span> MailRequest request)</span> </span>{
        System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"📬 [AI 서버] 익스텐션 본문 도착! Ollama로 교정 요청을 보냅니다..."</span>);

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 1. 시스템 프롬프트: AI의 자아를 없애고 엄격한 규칙을 부여합니다.</span>
        String systemPrompt = <span class="hljs-string">"당신은 한국어 비즈니스 이메일 교정 전문가입니다.\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"사용자의 메일 초안을 회사에서 쓰는 정중하고 격식 있는 존댓말(비즈니스 어조)로 수정하세요.\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"[절대 지켜야 할 규칙]\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"1. '안녕하시구려', '자네' 등의 비격식체나 반말은 '안녕하십니까', '요청하신' 등으로 완벽하게 수정할 것.\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"2. '네, 알겠습니다.', '여기 교정본입니다.', '죄송합니다.' 같은 너의 대답이나 인사말은 절대(Never) 출력하지 말 것.\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"3. 오직 교정이 완료된 메일 본문만 텍스트로 출력할 것."</span>;

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 2. 실제 데이터 (사용자 입력)</span>
        String prompt = request.text();

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 3. Ollama 상세 설정</span>
        Map&lt;String, Object&gt; ollamaRequest = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> HashMap&lt;&gt;();
        ollamaRequest.put(<span class="hljs-string">"model"</span>, OLLAMA_MODEL);
        ollamaRequest.put(<span class="hljs-string">"system"</span>, systemPrompt); <span class="hljs-comment">// 시스템 역할 부여</span>
        ollamaRequest.put(<span class="hljs-string">"prompt"</span>, prompt);       <span class="hljs-comment">// 순수 데이터만 전달</span>
        ollamaRequest.put(<span class="hljs-string">"stream"</span>, <span class="hljs-keyword">false</span>);
        
        <span class="hljs-comment">// ✨ 핵심: 창의성(temperature)을 0.1로 낮춰서 소설 쓰는 것을 원천 차단! (기본값은 0.8)</span>
        Map&lt;String, Object&gt; options = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> HashMap&lt;&gt;();
        options.put(<span class="hljs-string">"temperature"</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.1</span>); 
        ollamaRequest.put(<span class="hljs-string">"options"</span>, options);

        <span class="hljs-comment">// HTTP 통신 설정</span>
        HttpHeaders headers = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> HttpHeaders();
<span class="hljs-comment">// ... (이하 기존 코드와 동일) ...</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="7">🔄 다시 돌려봅시다!</h3><p data-path-to-node="8">스프링 부트를 재시작하시고, 똑같이 <b data-path-to-node="8" data-index-in-node="20">"안녕하시구려 백종현이올시다. 자네가 요청한 xx건은 완료처리하였습니다. 확인부탁드립니다."</b> 라고 입력해 보세요.</p><p data-path-to-node="9">이번엔 헛소리 하나 없이,
<b data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="15">"안녕하십니까, 백종현입니다. 요청하신 xx건에 대한 처리가 완료되었습니다. 확인 부탁드립니다."</b>
정도로, 진짜 대리님이 쓴 것처럼 완벽하게 각 잡힌 비즈니스 텍스트만 뱉어낼 것입니다!</p><p data-path-to-node="10">결과가 어떻게 나오는지 궁금하네요!</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" _nghost-ng-c3776646686="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2825300596-521 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3779276655="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-522 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c2825300596-521 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-522"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-522 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" _nghost-ng-c870918567="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-522 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c870918567="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="대답이 마음에 들어요" aria-label="대답이 마음에 들어요" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-pressed="false" jslog="173913;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_5fe69b537ba29dc4&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_1fcdf2927a368a2a&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,1]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-ic