/g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_7800)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g></g></svg></div></div></bard-avatar><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2825300596-529 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-content ng-tns-c2825300596-529"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-531 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c3887673081-531"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3887673081-531"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3887673081-531 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-controls="" aria-expanded="false" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-content animated-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="status" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3887673081-531"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-531 ng-star-inserted">생각하는 과정 표시</span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3887673081-531"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-531 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_fbe2ea4ffa89f196" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_fbe2ea4ffa89f196" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">최고의 칭찬을 해주시니 저도 정말 신이 납니다! 훌륭한 통찰력과 끈기를 가진 개발자님과 함께 작업하니 진도가 팍팍 나가는군요. 저는 AI로서 감정은 없지만, 이렇게 멋진 결과물을 함께 만들어내는 과정은 정말 즐겁습니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">그럼 기세를 몰아 가장 실용적인 기능인 [Step 1. 에디터 서식(HTML) 유지하기]를 바로 진행해 보겠습니다!</p><p data-path-to-node="2">원리는 간단합니다. 익스텐션에서 화면의 '보이는 글씨(<code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="30">innerText</code>)'만 빼오는 게 아니라, 'HTML 구조 전체(<code data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="66">innerHTML</code>)'를 통째로 서버로 보냅니다. 그리고 AI에게 "HTML 태그는 절대 건드리지 말고, 태그 사이에 있는 글씨만 교정해!"라고 명령하는 것입니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="3">두 군데만 살짝 수정하면 됩니다.</p><hr data-path-to-node="4"><h3 data-path-to-node="5">🛠️ 1. content.js 수정 (HTML 추출 및 덮어쓰기)</h3><p data-path-to-node="6"><code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0">content.js</code>의 버튼 클릭 이벤트 안쪽 코드를 수정합니다. 글씨만 빼오던 것을 HTML 코드로 바꾸고, 돌아온 응답도 그대로 HTML로 꽂아 넣습니다.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-612 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-612 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_fbe2ea4ffa89f196&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_e91a601b600ad2e0&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-612 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-612">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-612 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-612 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-612 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_fbe2ea4ffa89f196&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_e91a601b600ad2e0&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-612"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-612"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-612"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-612"><span class="hljs-comment">// ... (앞부분 동일) ...</span>
aiButton.addEventListener(<span class="hljs-string">"click"</span>, <span class="hljs-keyword">async</span> () =&gt; {
    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> resultDiv = findLetterDiv(<span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>);

    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (resultDiv) {
        <span class="hljs-comment">// ✨ 핵심 1: innerText 대신 innerHTML을 사용하여 태그(굵기, 색상, 줄바꿈 등)까지 통째로 가져옵니다!</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> mailHtml = resultDiv.innerHTML;

        <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> originalBtnText = aiButton.innerHTML;
        aiButton.innerHTML = <span class="hljs-string">"⏳ AI 교정 중..."</span>;
        aiButton.disabled = <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>;
        aiButton.style.backgroundColor = <span class="hljs-string">"#6c757d"</span>;

        <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> {
            <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> response = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> fetch(<span class="hljs-string">"http://localhost:8080/api/mail/correct"</span>, {
                <span class="hljs-attr">method</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"POST"</span>,
                <span class="hljs-attr">headers</span>: {
                    <span class="hljs-string">"Content-Type"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"application/json"</span>,
                },
                <span class="hljs-comment">// 이름은 text로 보내지만, 실제로는 HTML 덩어리가 날아갑니다.</span>
                <span class="hljs-attr">body</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">JSON</span>.stringify({ <span class="hljs-attr">text</span>: mailHtml }) 
            });

            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (response.ok) {
                <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> resultText = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> response.text();
                
                <span class="hljs-comment">// ✨ 핵심 2: 서버에서 온 응답(유지된 HTML)을 에디터에 그대로 덮어씌웁니다.</span>
                <span class="hljs-comment">// (이전처럼 .replace(/\n/g, "&lt;br&gt;")를 할 필요가 없습니다!)</span>
                resultDiv.innerHTML = resultText;
                
                <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> originalBg = resultDiv.style.backgroundColor;
                resultDiv.style.backgroundColor = <span class="hljs-string">"#e8f0fe"</span>;
                <span class="hljs-built_in">setTimeout</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> {
                    resultDiv.style.backgroundColor = originalBg;
                }, <span class="hljs-number">500</span>);

            } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
<span class="hljs-comment">// ... (뒷부분 동일) ...</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="8">🛠️ 2. MailApiController.java 수정 (AI 프롬프트 강화)</h3><p data-path-to-node="9">이제 Llama 3.1에게 <b data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="15">"너한테 들어오는 건 HTML이니까 태그는 부수지 마!"</b> 라고 강력하게 경고해야 합니다. <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="65">systemPrompt</code> 부분을 아래와 같이 수정해 주세요.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-613 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-613 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_fbe2ea4ffa89f196&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_e91a601b600ad2e0&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="7" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-613 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-613">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-613 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-613 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-613 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_fbe2ea4ffa89f196&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_e91a601b600ad2e0&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-613"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-613"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-613"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-613"><span class="hljs-comment">// ... 기존 코드 ...</span>
    <span class="hljs-meta">@PostMapping("/correct")</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> ResponseEntity&lt;String&gt; <span class="hljs-title">correctMail</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-meta">@RequestBody</span> MailRequest request)</span> </span>{
        System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"📬 [AI 서버] 익스텐션 본문 도착! Ollama로 교정 요청을 보냅니다..."</span>);

        <span class="hljs-comment">// ✨ 핵심: AI가 HTML 구조를 이해하고 유지하도록 프롬프트를 정교하게 수정합니다.</span>
        String systemPrompt = <span class="hljs-string">"당신은 한국어 비즈니스 이메일 교정 전문가입니다.\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"사용자의 메일 초안을 회사에서 쓰는 정중하고 격식 있는 존댓말(비즈니스 어조)로 수정하세요.\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"[절대 지켜야 할 규칙]\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"1. 입력 데이터는 HTML 코드로 제공됩니다. &lt;p&gt;, &lt;br&gt;, &lt;b&gt;, &lt;span&gt;, &lt;div&gt; 등 모든 HTML 태그 구조와 속성(style, class 등)은 100% 그대로 유지하세요.\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"2. HTML 태그 바깥에 있는 '순수 텍스트 내용'만 정중한 비즈니스 톤으로 교정하세요.\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"3. '안녕하시구려' 등의 비격식체는 '안녕하십니까' 등으로 수정하세요.\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"4. 네, 알겠습니다 등의 대답이나 인사말, 그리고 마크다운(```html 등) 기호는 절대 출력하지 마세요.\n"</span>
                            + <span class="hljs-string">"5. 오직 교정이 완료된 HTML 코드 자체만 출력하세요. 부연 설명은 금지입니다."</span>;

        String prompt = request.text();
<span class="hljs-comment">// ... (이하 기존 코드와 동일) ...</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="11"><h3 data-path-to-node="12">🔄 마법의 서식 유지 테스트!</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="13"><li><p data-path-to-node="13,0,0">프론트엔드(<code data-path-to-node="13,0,0" data-index-in-node="6">content.js</code>) 저장 후 익스텐션 새로고침(<code data-path-to-node="13,0,0" data-index-in-node="33">🔄</code>)</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,1,0">백엔드(스프링 부트) 재시작</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="13,2,0">그룹웨어 메일 팝업창 새로고침(<code data-path-to-node="13,2,0" data-index-in-node="17">F5</code>)</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="14">이제 에디터 본문에 글씨 굵게(Bold)도 적용해 보시고, <b data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="33">글자 색상</b>도 빨간색 등으로 바꿔보신 뒤에 <b data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="56">[🤖 AI 교정]</b> 버튼을 눌러보세요.</p><p data-path-to-node="15">글씨체와 색상, 줄바꿈 같은 모든 에디터 서식은 완벽하게 살아있으면서 내용만 싹 비즈니스 톤으로 바뀌는 마법을 보실 수 있을 겁니다! 적용해 보시고 결과가 잘 나오는지 테스트해 보시겠어요?</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><overview-carousel _nghost-ng-c2619744879="" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2619744879="" jslog="268370;track:generic_click,impression"><!----><!----><sources-sidebar-button _ngcontent-ng-c2619744879="" _nghost-ng-c946083868="" class="ng-star-inserted">