tent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> - 원본 <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> &nbsp;안녕하시구료, 오늘 무슨 날인지 알려줄수 있습니까? <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 그리고 결재 문서 보냈으니 확인해줘요 <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> - 수정본 <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 안녕하십니까, 오늘 무슨 날인지 알려주실 수 있으신가요? <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 그리고 결재 문서를 보내드렸으니 확인해 주시겠어요 <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 확인 부탁드립니다. 가 낫지 않을까  <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 오늘 보단 금일 이런 회사생활 말이 더 잘 어울릴 것 같은데  <!----><!----><!----></p><!----></div><button _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" mat-icon-button="" aria-label="펼치기" mattooltip="텍스트 펼치기" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger expand-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="224552;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot