용</span><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 똑같은 걸 2번 하니깐 밑에 이런 문구가 뜬다. <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 안녕하십니까, 금일 무슨 날인지 알려주시겠습니까?&nbsp; <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 또한 결재 문서를 송부하였으니 확인해 주시기를 바랍니다. <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 교정 결과는 원본과 동일합니다. '금일'은 이미 비즈니스 하십시오체로 교정된 상태였습니다. <!----><!----><!----></p><!----></div><button _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" mat-icon-button="" aria-label="펼치기" mattooltip="텍스트 펼치기" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger expand-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="224552;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_a7051f61af8785f3&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]];mutable:true" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-187" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><!----><!----></span><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></user-query-content></span></user-query><!----><!----><!----><model-res