7673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3887673081-551"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-551 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_af5cddf1882509c4" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_af5cddf1882509c4" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">탁월한 선택입니다!</p><p data-path-to-node="1">단일 기능이었던 우리 익스텐션을 <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="18">[정중하게]</b>, <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="26">[간결하게]</b>, <b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="34">[영문 번역]</b> 3가지 모드를 지원하는 완벽한 다기능 툴로 업그레이드해 보겠습니다. 프론트엔드와 백엔드를 조금씩만 손보면 됩니다!</p><hr data-path-to-node="2"><h3 data-path-to-node="3">🛠️ 1. 스프링 부트 DTO 수정 (모드 값 받기)</h3><p data-path-to-node="4">익스텐션에서 던져주는 '어떤 모드로 할지'에 대한 값(<code data-path-to-node="4" data-index-in-node="30">mode</code>)을 서버가 받을 수 있도록 바구니(DTO)를 늘려줍니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="5"><code data-path-to-node="5" data-index-in-node="0">MailRequest.java</code></p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-617 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-617 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_af5cddf1882509c4&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4ea791db5a115e20&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="5" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-617 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-617">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-617 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-617 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-617 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_af5cddf1882509c4&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4ea791db5a115e20&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-617"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-617"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-617"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-617"><span class="hljs-keyword">package</span> com.example.mailassistant.dto;

<span class="hljs-comment">// 텍스트뿐만 아니라 'mode'라는 옵션값도 같이 받도록 수정합니다.</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> record <span class="hljs-title">MailRequest</span><span class="hljs-params">(String text, String mode)</span> </span>{
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="7"><h3 data-path-to-node="8">🛠️ 2. 스프링 부트 컨트롤러 수정 (모드별 프롬프트 분기)</h3><p data-path-to-node="9"><code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="0">MailApiController.java</code>를 수정합니다. 넘어온 <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="35">mode</code> 값에 따라 각기 다른 성격의 '시스템 프롬프트'를 끼워 넣도록 조건문(<code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="79">switch</code> 또는 <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="89">if</code>)을 추가합니다.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-618 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-618 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_af5cddf1882509c4&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4ea791db5a115e20&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="7" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-618 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-618">Java</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-618 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-618 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-618 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_af5cddf1882509c4&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4ea791db5a115e20&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-618"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-618"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-618"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-618"><span class="hljs-comment">// ... 기존 임포트 ...</span>

    <span class="hljs-meta">@PostMapping("/correct")</span>
    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">public</span> ResponseEntity&lt;String&gt; <span class="hljs-title">correctMail</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-meta">@RequestBody</span> MailRequest request)</span> </span>{
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 프론트에서 모드 값을 안 보냈다면 기본값은 'formal(정중하게)'로 세팅</span>
        String mode = request.mode() != <span class="hljs-keyword">null</span> ? request.mode() : <span class="hljs-string">"formal"</span>;
        System.out.println(<span class="hljs-string">"📬 [AI 서버] 모드 ["</span> + mode + <span class="hljs-string">"] 로 교정 요청 도착!"</span>);

        String systemPrompt = <span class="hljs-string">""</span>;

        <span class="hljs-comment">// 💡 선택된 모드에 따라 AI의 '자아(프롬프트)'를 바꿉니다!</span>
        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class="hljs-string">"concise"</span>.equals(mode)) {
            systemPrompt = <span class="hljs-string">"당신은 한국 대기업의 비즈니스 텍스트 요약 전문가입니다.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"입력된 HTML 문서의 태그 구조를 유지한 채, 텍스트 내용을 핵심만 남기고 아주 간결하게 줄이세요.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"[필수 지침]\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"1. 불필요한 수식어나 긴 인사말은 과감히 삭제하고 요점만 '하십시오체'로 전달할 것.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"2. 항목이 많을 경우 1. 2. 3. 같은 개조식(Bullet point)으로 정리해도 좋음.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"3. HTML 구조 유지, 너 자신의 대답 금지."</span>;
        } 
        <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class="hljs-string">"english"</span>.equals(mode)) {
            systemPrompt = <span class="hljs-string">"당신은 실리콘밸리 IT 기업의 비즈니스 영문 번역가입니다.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"입력된 HTML 문서의 태그 구조를 100% 유지한 채, 텍스트 내용을 세련되고 프로페셔널한 비즈니스 영어로 번역하세요.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"[필수 지침]\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"1. 단순 직역이 아닌, 네이티브가 자주 쓰는 정중한 비즈니스 이메일 표현을 사용할 것.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"2. HTML 구조 유지, 너 자신의 대답 금지."</span>;
        } 
        <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 기본 모드 (formal - 우리가 힘들게 깎아둔 완벽한 정중체 프롬프트)</span>
            systemPrompt = <span class="hljs-string">"당신은 한국 대기업의 비즈니스 텍스트 교정 전문가입니다.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"입력된 HTML 문서의 태그 구조를 100% 유지한 채, 텍스트 내용만 격식 있는 '비즈니스 하십시오체(다나까체)'로 교정하세요.\n\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"[필수 지침]\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"1. 어조: '~요', '~까?' 등 구어체는 '~습니다', '~바랍니다', '~안녕하십니까'로 완벽히 수정.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"2. 용어: 오늘-&gt;금일, 내일-&gt;명일, 어제-&gt;작일, 보내다-&gt;송부하다/전달하다.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"3. 내용 보존: 원본의 인사말이나 핵심 내용은 지우지 말 것.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"4. 무반응 원칙: 이미 완벽하면 원본을 그대로 반환할 것.\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"5. AI 대답 절대 금지.\n\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"[교정 예시]\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"입력: &lt;p&gt;안녕하시구료, &lt;b&gt;오늘&lt;/b&gt; 무슨 날인지 알려줄수 있습니까?&lt;/p&gt;\n"</span>
                         + <span class="hljs-string">"출력: &lt;p&gt;안녕하십니까, &lt;b&gt;금일&lt;/b&gt; 무슨 날인지 공유 부탁드립니다.&lt;/p&gt;"</span>;
        }

        String prompt = request.text();

        Map&lt;String, Object&gt; ollamaRequest = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> HashMap&lt;&gt;();
        ollamaRequest.put(<span class="hljs-string">"model"</span>, OLLAMA_MODEL); <span class="hljs-comment">// "llama3.1"</span>
        ollamaRequest.put(<span class="hljs-string">"system"</span>, systemPrompt); 
        ollamaRequest.put(<span class="hljs-string">"prompt"</span>, prompt);       
        ollamaRequest.put(<span class="hljs-string">"stream"</span>, <span class="hljs-keyword">false</span>);
        
        Map&lt;String, Object&gt; options = <span class="hljs-keyword">new</span> HashMap&lt;&gt;();
        options.put(<span class="hljs-string">"temperature"</span>, <span class="hljs-number">0.1</span>); 
        ollamaRequest.put(<span class="hljs-string">"options"</span>, options);

        <span class="hljs-comment">// ... (이하 HTTP 통신 및 return 로직은 기존과 100% 동일합니다!)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">// ...</span>
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="11"><h3 data-path-to-node="12">🛠️ 3. 익스텐션 UI 수정 (content.js)</h3><p data-path-to-node="13">이제 하나의 뚱뚱한 버튼 대신, 예쁘고 직관적인 <b data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="27">3개의 기능 버튼</b>을 달아주고 클릭할 때마다 서버로 다른 <code data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node="58">mode</code> 값을 보내도록 수정합니다!</p><p data-path-to-node="14"><code data-path-to-node="14" data-index-in-node="0">content.js</code>의 버튼 생성 부분을 통째로 아래 코드로 교체해 주세요.</p><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-619 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-619 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_af5cddf1882509c4&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4ea791db5a115e20&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="9" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-619 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-619">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-619 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-619 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-619 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_af5cddf1882509c4&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4ea791db5a115e20&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-619"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-619"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-619"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-619"><span class="hljs-built_in">console</span>.log(<span class="hljs-string">"🚀 [멀티 모드] AI 버튼 패널 로딩 완료"</span>);

<span class="hljs-comment">// --- 1. 버튼들을 담을 컨테이너(패널) 만들기 ---</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> aiPanel = <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.createElement(<span class="hljs-string">"div"</span>);
aiPanel.style.position = <span class="hljs-string">"fixed"</span>;
aiPanel.style.bottom = <span class="hljs-string">"30px"</span>;
aiPanel.style.right = <span class="hljs-string">"30px"</span>;
aiPanel.style.display = <span class="hljs-string">"flex"</span>;
aiPanel.style.gap = <span class="hljs-string">"10px"</span>; <span class="hljs-comment">// 버튼 사이 간격</span>
aiPanel.style.zIndex = <span class="hljs-string">"9999"</span>;
<span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.body.appendChild(aiPanel);

<span class="hljs-comment">// --- 2. 버튼 찍어내는 공장(함수) ---</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">createAiButton</span>(<span class="hljs-params">text, bgColor</span>) </span>{
    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> btn = <span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>.createElement(<span class="hljs-string">"button"</span>);
    btn.innerHTML = text;
    btn.style.padding = <span class="hljs-string">"12px 18px"</span>;
    btn.style.backgroundColor = bgColor;
    btn.style.color = <span class="hljs-string">"white"</span>;
    btn.style.border = <span class="hljs-string">"none"</span>;
    btn.style.borderRadius = <span class="hljs-string">"30px"</span>;
    btn.style.boxShadow = <span class="hljs-string">"0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.2)"</span>;
    btn.style.fontSize = <span class="hljs-string">"14px"</span>;
    btn.style.fontWeight = <span class="hljs-string">"bold"</span>;
    btn.style.cursor = <span class="hljs-string">"pointer"</span>;
    btn.style.transition = <span class="hljs-string">"all 0.2s"</span>;
    
    <span class="hljs-comment">// 마우스 올렸을 때 살짝 커지는 애니메이션</span>
    btn.onmouseover = <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> btn.style.transform = <span class="hljs-string">"scale(1.05)"</span>;
    btn.onmouseout = <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> btn.style.transform = <span class="hljs-string">"scale(1.0)"</span>;
    
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> btn;
}

<span class="hljs-comment">// 3개의 멋진 버튼 생성</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> btnFormal = createAiButton(<span class="hljs-string">"👔 정중하게"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"#0056b3"</span>); <span class="hljs-comment">// 파란색</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> btnConcise = createAiButton(<span class="hljs-string">"⚡ 간결하게"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"#28a745"</span>); <span class="hljs-comment">// 초록색</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> btnEnglish = createAiButton(<span class="hljs-string">"🔤 영문번역"</span>, <span class="hljs-string">"#6f42c1"</span>); <span class="hljs-comment">// 보라색</span>

aiPanel.appendChild(btnFormal);
aiPanel.appendChild(btnConcise);
aiPanel.appendChild(btnEnglish);

<span class="hljs-comment">// 불도저 탐색 함수 (기존과 동일하게 유지!)</span>
<span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">findLetterDiv</span>(<span class="hljs-params">doc</span>) </span>{
    <span class="hljs-keyword">let</span> letter = doc.querySelector(<span class="hljs-string">'div[name="letter"]'</span>);
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (letter) <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> letter;
    <span class="hljs-keyword">let</span> iframes = doc.querySelectorAll(<span class="hljs-string">"iframe"</span>);
    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-keyword">let</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; i &lt; iframes.length; i++) {
        <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> {
            <span class="hljs-keyword">let</span> iframeDoc = iframes[i].contentDocument || iframes[i].contentWindow.document;
            <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (iframeDoc) {
                <span class="hljs-keyword">let</span> foundInside = findLetterDiv(iframeDoc);
                <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (foundInside) <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> foundInside;
            }
        } <span class="hljs-keyword">catch</span> (error) { <span class="hljs-keyword">continue</span>; }
    }
    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">null</span>;
}

<span class="hljs-comment">// --- 3. 통신 핵심 로직 (재사용 가능하도록 함수로 분리) ---</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">async</span> <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">requestAiCorrection</span>(<span class="hljs-params">mode, buttonElement</span>) </span>{
    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> resultDiv = findLetterDiv(<span class="hljs-built_in">document</span>);
    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (!resultDiv) {
        alert(<span class="hljs-string">"🚨 본문(letter) 영역을 찾을 수 없습니다."</span>);
        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span>;
    }

    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> mailHtml = resultDiv.innerHTML;
    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> originalBtnText = buttonElement.innerHTML;
    <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> originalBtnBg = buttonElement.style.backgroundColor;

    <span class="hljs-comment">// 로딩 상태 UI 처리</span>
    buttonElement.innerHTML = <span class="hljs-string">"⏳ 처리 중..."</span>;
    buttonElement.disabled = <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>;
    buttonElement.style.backgroundColor = <span class="hljs-string">"#6c757d"</span>;

    <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span> {
        <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> response = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> fetch(<span class="hljs-string">"http://localhost:8080/api/mail/correct"</span>, {
            <span class="hljs-attr">method</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"POST"</span>,
            <span class="hljs-attr">headers</span>: { <span class="hljs-string">"Content-Type"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"application/json"</span> },
            <span class="hljs-comment">// ✨ 핵심: 선택한 mode 값을 스프링 부트로 함께 보냅니다!</span>
            <span class="hljs-attr">body</span>: <span class="hljs-built_in">JSON</span>.stringify({ <span class="hljs-attr">text</span>: mailHtml, <span class="hljs-attr">mode</span>: mode }) 
        });

        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (response.ok) {
            <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> resultText = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> response.text();
            resultDiv.innerHTML = resultText;
            
            <span class="hljs-comment">// 성공 시 에디터 배경 반짝임 효과</span>
            <span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> originalBg = resultDiv.style.backgroundColor;
            resultDiv.style.backgroundColor = <span class="hljs-string">"#e8f0fe"</span>;
            <span class="hljs-built_in">setTimeout</span>(<span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> resultDiv.style.backgroundColor = originalBg, <span class="hljs-number">500</span>);
        } <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> {
            alert(<span class="hljs-string">"🚨 서버 에러: "</span> + response.status);
        }
    } <span class="hljs-keyword">catch</span> (error) {
        alert(<span class="hljs-string">"🚨 서버 통신 실패! 스프링 부트 확인 부탁드립니다.\n"</span> + error.message);
    } <span class="hljs-keyword">finally</span> {
        <span class="hljs-comment">// 원래 상태로 버튼 복구</span>
        buttonElement.innerHTML = originalBtnText;
        buttonElement.disabled = <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>;
        buttonElement.style.backgroundColor = originalBtnBg;
    }
}

<span class="hljs-comment">// --- 4. 각 버튼에 클릭 이벤트 연결 ---</span>
btnFormal.addEventListener(<span class="hljs-string">"click"</span>, <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> requestAiCorrection(<span class="hljs-string">"formal"</span>, btnFormal));
btnConcise.addEventListener(<span class="hljs-string">"click"</span>, <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> requestAiCorrection(<span class="hljs-string">"concise"</span>, btnConcise));
btnEnglish.addEventListener(<span class="hljs-string">"click"</span>, <span class="hljs-function">() =&gt;</span> requestAiCorrection(<span class="hljs-string">"english"</span>, btnEnglish));
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><hr data-path-to-node="16"><h3 data-path-to-node="17">🚀 멀티 유니버스 테스트!</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="18"><li><p data-path-to-node="18,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="18,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">MailRequest.java</code>, <code data-path-to-node="18,0,0" data-index-in-node="18">MailApiController.java</code> 수정 후 <b data-path-to-node="18,0,0" data-index-in-node="46">스프링 부트 재시작</b></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="18,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">content.js</code> 저장 후 <b data-path-to-node="18,1,0" data-index-in-node="16">크롬 익스텐션 새로고침(🔄)</b></p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="18,2,0">그룹웨어 <b data-path-to-node="18,2,0" data-index-in-node="5">메일 창 새로고침(F5)</b></p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="19">이제 우측 하단에 알록달록하고 멋진 3개의 버튼이 생겼을 겁니다!
본문에 글을 대충 적어놓고, [👔 정중하게]를 눌렀을 때와 [⚡ 간결하게]를 눌렀을 때, 그리고 [🔤 영문번역]을 눌렀을 때 AI가 어떻게 다르게 텍스트를 바꿔주는지 마음껏 요리해 보세요! (영어 번역 퀄리티에 깜짝 놀라실 겁니다!)</p><p data-path-to-node="20">결과가 기대되네요! 해보시고 후기 들려주세요.</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-footer complete has-thoughts gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" _nghost-ng-c3776646686="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2825300596-549 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3779276655="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-550 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c2825300596-549 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-550"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-550 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" _nghost-ng-c870918567="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-550 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c870918567="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="대답이 마음에 들어요" aria-label="대답이 마음에 들어요" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-pressed="false" jslog="173913;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_af5cddf1882509c4&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_4ea791db5a115e20&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,n