2481a33&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-m action-button-icon google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="user-query-bubble-with-background enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="horizontal-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" role="heading" aria-level="2" class="query-text gds-body-l query-text-animated collapsed" dir="ltr"><span _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-user-query-label">말씀하신 내용</span><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 정중하게 클릭했는데 밑에 또 뭐야.. <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 안녕하십니까, <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> KG ICT 백종현입니다. <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 요청하신 개발 작업을 완료하였습니다. <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 확인 부탁드립니다. <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 아울러, 추가 문의가 필요하시면 언제든지 연락바랍니다. <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 교정 내용: 1. 어조: '~구려' -&gt; '~십니까' 2. 용어: '요청주신' -&gt; '요청하신', '끝냈습니다' -&gt; '완료하였습니다' 3. 내용 보존: 원본의 인사말, 핵심 내용은 유지 <!----><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"><!----><br _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----></p><p _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" class="query-text-line ng-star-inserted"> 교정내용은 나오면 안되지 <!----><!----><!----></p><!----></div><button _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" mat-icon-button="" aria-label="펼치기" mattooltip="텍스트 펼치기" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger expand-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="224552;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_2dec5047651e0f25&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,null,null,null,null,null,1,null,null,null,0]];mutable:true" aria-describedby="cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-187" cdk-describedby-host="ng-1"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c120227718="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-l google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></span><!----><!----></span><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----></user-query-content></span></user-query><!----><!----><!----><model-response _ngcontent-ng-c2508777