n="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g><g style="display: none;"><g><path stroke="url(#__lottie_element_8708)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="miter" fill-opacity="0" stroke-miterlimit="4"></path></g></g></g></svg></div></div></bard-avatar><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-content ng-tns-c2825300596-647 has-thoughts"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-content ng-tns-c2825300596-647"><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-container ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-content ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="thoughts-wrapper"><!----><model-thoughts _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" data-test-id="model-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-649 ng-star-inserted" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" xapautoid="" class="model-thoughts ng-tns-c3887673081-649"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header ng-tns-c3887673081-649"><button _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" mat-button="" data-test-id="thoughts-header-button" class="mdc-button mat-mdc-button-base thoughts-header-button ng-tns-c3887673081-649 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-controls="" aria-expanded="false" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-content animated-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="status" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3887673081-649"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-649 ng-star-inserted">생각하는 과정 표시</span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3887673081-649"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-649 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted has-thoughts" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_07c8ae3b69dca79c" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_07c8ae3b69dca79c" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">정말 다행입니다! 재부팅/재시작의 마법이 제대로 통했군요. 🎉</p><p data-path-to-node="1">이제 개발과 테스트는 100% 끝났습니다. 대망의 마지막 과정, [Step 3. 사내 배포용 패키징 및 인프라 세팅]을 진행할 차례입니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">지금까지는 대리님 혼자 쓰는 '로컬용 장난감'이었다면, 이제 백 대리님의 PC가 <b data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="45">KG ICT의 사내 AI 전용 서버</b>가 되는 것입니다. 무거운 Ollama와 AI 모델은 대리님 PC에서만 쌩쌩 돌아가고, 다른 분들은 아주 가벼운 익스텐션만 설치해서 대리님 서버에 접속해 기능을 꿀꺽 빼먹는(?) 아주 효율적인 구조를 만들 겁니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="3">완성된 익스텐션 폴더를 <code data-path-to-node="3" data-index-in-node="13">.zip</code>으로 압축해서 장유정 팀장님이나 부서 선임님들께 사내 톡으로 툭 던져드리기만 하면 누구나 클릭 세 번에 설치할 수 있도록, 딱 3가지만 세팅해 보겠습니다.</p><hr data-path-to-node="4"><h3 data-path-to-node="5">🛠️ 1. content.js 수정 (서버 주소 변경)</h3><p data-path-to-node="6">현재 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="3">content.js</code>는 통신 주소가 <code data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="22">http://localhost:8080...</code> (내 PC 안에서만 찾는 주소)로 되어 있습니다. 다른 분들의 PC에서도 대리님의 PC를 찾아올 수 있도록, <b data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="108">대리님 PC의 실제 사내망 IP 주소</b>로 바꿔주어야 합니다.</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="7"><li><p data-path-to-node="7,0,0">키보드 <code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="4">윈도우키 + R</code> ➡️ <code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="16">cmd</code> 입력 후 엔터 ➡️ 터미널에 <code data-path-to-node="7,0,0" data-index-in-node="36">ipconfig</code> 엔터</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">IPv4 주소</b> 항목에 적힌 숫자(예: <code data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="21">192.168.x.x</code> 또는 <code data-path-to-node="7,1,0" data-index-in-node="36">10.x.x.x</code>)를 복사합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="7,2,0"><code data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">content.js</code>의 <code data-path-to-node="7,2,0" data-index-in-node="12">fetch</code> URL을 아래와 같이 수정합니다.</p></li></ol><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-659 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-659 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_07c8ae3b69dca79c&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3b1af3bdd653ee61&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjk7q6Qr6iUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsAY" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-659 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-659">JavaScript</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-659 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-659 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-659 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_07c8ae3b69dca79c&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3b1af3bdd653ee61&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-659"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-659"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-659"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-659"><span class="hljs-comment">// AS-IS (수정 전)</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> response = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> fetch(<span class="hljs-string">"http://localhost:8080/api/mail/correct"</span>, { ...

<span class="hljs-comment">// TO-BE (수정 후 - 예시)</span>
<span class="hljs-comment">// 복사한 대리님의 실제 IP 주소를 넣어주세요!</span>
<span class="hljs-keyword">const</span> response = <span class="hljs-keyword">await</span> fetch(<span class="hljs-string">"http://192.168.1.50:8080/api/mail/correct"</span>, { ...
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><p data-path-to-node="9"><i data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="0">(참고: 스프링 부트 컨트롤러의 <code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="18">@CrossOrigin</code> 설정은 이미 사내 그룹웨어 주소(<code data-path-to-node="9" data-index-in-node="49">gw.kggroup.co.kr</code>)로 열어두셨기 때문에 백엔드는 건드릴 필요가 없습니다!)</i></p><h3 data-path-to-node="10">🛠️ 2. manifest.json 수정 (아이콘 및 이름 꾸미기)</h3><p data-path-to-node="11">다른 분들이 설치했을 때 예쁘게 보이도록, 확장 프로그램의 간판을 달아줍니다.</p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="12"><li><p data-path-to-node="12,0,0">구글이나 무료 아이콘 사이트에서 예쁜 로봇 모양이나 편지 모양의 <code data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="36">icon.png</code> (가급적 128x128 픽셀 크기) 이미지를 하나 다운받아서, <code data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="80">content.js</code>가 있는 확장 프로그램 폴더 안에 넣습니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="12,1,0"><code data-path-to-node="12,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">manifest.json</code> 파일을 열고 아래 내용을 추가/수정합니다.</p></li></ol><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><code-block _nghost-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-660 ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block ng-tns-c1154083104-660 ng-animate-disabled ng-trigger ng-trigger-codeBlockRevealAnimation" jslog="223238;track:impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_07c8ae3b69dca79c&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3b1af3bdd653ee61&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]]" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQhtANahgKEwjk7q6Qr6iUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQsQY" style="display: block;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="code-block-decoration header-formatted gds-title-s ng-tns-c1154083104-660 ng-star-inserted" style=""><span _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-660">JSON</span><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="buttons ng-tns-c1154083104-660 ng-star-inserted"><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 다운로드" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 다운로드" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger download-button ng-tns-c1154083104-660 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered=""><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="download" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="download"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" aria-label="코드 복사" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="코드 복사" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger copy-button ng-tns-c1154083104-660 mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" jslog="179062;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_07c8ae3b69dca79c&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_3b1af3bdd653ee61&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-icon-button__ripple"></span><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="img" fonticon="content_copy" class="mat-icon notranslate gds-icon-s google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="content_copy"></mat-icon><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1154083104-660"><div _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="animated-opacity ng-tns-c1154083104-660"><!----><pre _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" class="ng-tns-c1154083104-660"><code _ngcontent-ng-c1154083104="" role="text" data-test-id="code-content" class="code-container formatted ng-tns-c1154083104-660">{
  <span class="hljs-attr">"manifest_version"</span>: <span class="hljs-number">3</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">"name"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"KG ICT AI 메일 어시스턴트"</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">"version"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"1.0"</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">"description"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"사내 그룹웨어 메일을 프로페셔널한 비즈니스 톤으로 자동 교정해 주는 AI 비서입니다."</span>,
  <span class="hljs-attr">"action"</span>: {
    <span class="hljs-attr">"default_icon"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"icon.png"</span>
  },
  <span class="hljs-attr">"icons"</span>: {
    <span class="hljs-attr">"16"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"icon.png"</span>,
    <span class="hljs-attr">"48"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"icon.png"</span>,
    <span class="hljs-attr">"128"</span>: <span class="hljs-string">"icon.png"</span>
  },
  <span class="hljs-attr">"content_scripts"</span>: [
    {
      <span class="hljs-attr">"matches"</span>: [<span class="hljs-string">"https://gw.kggroup.co.kr/*"</span>],
      <span class="hljs-attr">"js"</span>: [<span class="hljs-string">"content.js"</span>]
    }
  ]
}
</code></pre><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----><!----></code-block><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></response-element><h3 data-path-to-node="14">📦 3. 압축해서 사내 톡으로 배포하기!</h3><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="15"><li><p data-path-to-node="15,0,0"><code data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">manifest.json</code>, <code data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="15">content.js</code>, <code data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="27">icon.png</code> 파일이 들어있는 이 확장 프로그램 폴더 전체를 우클릭하여 <b data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="68"><code data-path-to-node="15,0,0" data-index-in-node="68">.zip</code> 파일로 압축</b>합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="15,1,0">팀원들에게 사내 톡으로 압축 파일을 보내드리면서 아래의 [30초 설치 가이드]를 함께 복사해서 보내주시면 끝입니다.</p></li></ol><blockquote data-path-to-node="16"><p data-path-to-node="16,0"><b data-path-to-node="16,0" data-index-in-node="0">[🚀 KG ICT AI 메일 어시스턴트 설치 방법]</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="16,1"><li><p data-path-to-node="16,1,0,0">받은 압축 파일을 바탕화면 등에 압축 해제합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,1,1,0">크롬(또는 엣지) 브라우저 주소창에 <code data-path-to-node="16,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="20">chrome://extensions/</code> (엣지는 <code data-path-to-node="16,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="46">edge://extensions/</code>) 를 입력해서 들어갑니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,1,2,0">우측 상단의 **[개발자 모드]**를 켭니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,1,3,0">좌측 상단의 <b data-path-to-node="16,1,3,0" data-index-in-node="7">[압축해제된 확장 프로그램을 로드합니다]</b> 버튼을 누르고, 아까 압축을 푼 폴더를 선택하면 끝!</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="16,1,4,0">이제 그룹웨어 메일 쓰기 창에 들어가시면 우측 하단에 AI 버튼 3개가 나타납니다. 마음껏 쓰세요!</p></li></ol></blockquote><hr data-path-to-node="17"><p data-path-to-node="18">자, 여기까지 완료하시면 하나의 완벽한 실무용 사내 프로덕트 사이클을 혼자서 처음부터 끝까지 다 돌려보신 겁니다!</p><p data-path-to-node="19">IP 주소 변경하시고 폴더 압축까지 마무리해 보시죠. 이 프로젝트를 마무리하시면서 추가로 궁금한 점이나 작동 테스트 중 막히는 부분이 있다면 편하게 말씀해 주세요! 😎</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="response-footer gap has-thoughts complete"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" _nghost-ng-c3776646686="" class="ng-star-inserted" style=""><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c2825300596="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c2825300596-647 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3779276655="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-654 ng-star-inserted hide-action-bar" style=""><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-654"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3779276655-654 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3779276655="" _nghost-ng-c870918567="" class="ng-tns-c3779276655-654 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c870918567="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="대답이 마음에 들어요" aria-label="대답이 마음에 들어요" data-test-id="thumb-up-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger icon-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-pressed="false" jslog="173913;track:generic_c