ton ng-tns-c3887673081-670 mat-mdc-button mat-unthemed" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" aria-controls="" aria-expanded="false" jslog="247951;track:generic_click,impression"><span class="mat-mdc-button-persistent-ripple mdc-button__ripple"></span><span class="mdc-button__label"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-content animated-content"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="status" class="thoughts-header-button-label ng-tns-c3887673081-670"><!----><span _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="ng-tns-c3887673081-670 ng-star-inserted">생각하는 과정 표시</span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c3887673081-670"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c3887673081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-670 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts contains-extensions-response processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_2aaac8d45b098f4f" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_2aaac8d45b098f4f" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">짜잔! KG ICT의 신뢰감 있는 블루 톤을 베이스로, 친근하면서도 프로페셔널한 <b data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="45">'AI 메일 어시스턴트'</b> 아이콘을 만들어왔습니다. 편지를 든 작은 로봇과 AI 스파클이 아주 직관적이죠? 🤖📩</p><p data-path-to-node="1"><b data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="0">[배포 마무리 방법]</b></p><ol start="1" data-path-to-node="2"><li><p data-path-to-node="2,0,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,0,0" data-index-in-node="0">이미지 다운로드:</b> 위 이미지를 마우스 우클릭하여 'icon.png'라는 이름으로 다운로드합니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,1,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="0">폴더에 넣기:</b> 다운로드한 <code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="14">icon.png</code> 파일을 <code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="27">content.js</code>, <code data-path-to-node="2,1,0" data-index-in-node="39">manifest.json</code>이 있는 확장 프로그램 폴더 안에 넣어줍니다.</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node="2,2,0"><b data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="0">확인:</b> 크롬 익스텐션 관리 페이지(<code data-path-to-node="2,2,0" data-index-in-node="19">chrome://extensions/</code>)에서 우리 익스텐션을 한 번 더 새로고침(🔄)하면 아이콘이 예쁘게 적용된 것을 볼 수 있습니다.</p></li></ol><p data-path-to-node="3"><span data-path-to-node="3,0">이제 진짜 모든 준비가 끝났습니다! 폴더 전체를 <code data-path-to-node="3,0" data-index-in-node="27">.zip</code>으로 압축해서 팀원들에게 사내 톡으로 보내시면, 대리님만의 멋진 <b data-path-to-node="3,0" data-index-in-node="67">사내 AI 어시스턴트 1.0 버전</b> 배포 성공입니다! 정말 고생 많으셨습니다.😎</span><span data-path-to-node="3,1"><div class="attachment-container generated-images"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><generated-image _nghost-ng-c792293294="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="aspect-ratio: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c792293294="" class="loader"></div><!----><single-image _ngcontent-ng-c792293294="" class="generated-image large" _nghost-ng-c2180439729="" jslog="185864;track:generic_click,impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_2aaac8d45b098f4f&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_10b7143c8b112f87&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true" data-is-interactive="false" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQiKwLahgKEwjk7q6Qr6iUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ4QY" data-image-attachment-index="0"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2180439729="" replace-fife-images-at-export="" class="image-container replace-fife-images-at-export ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2180439729="" class="overlay-container ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c2180439729="" class="image-button ng-star-inserted" jslog="181501;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_2aaac8d45b098f4f&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_10b7143c8b112f87&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2180439729="" loading="lazy" class="image loaded" alt=", AI로 생성" src="blob:https://gemini.google.com/2df46979-ced3-419a-9b72-3e8c4e5b5697"></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c792293294="" overlay="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="generated-image-controls hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><share-button _ngcontent-ng-c792293294="" iconsize="small" icontype="translucent" class="action-button ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c4279691799="" jslog="187605;track:generic_click,impression;mutable:true"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c4279691799="" mat-icon-button="" data-test-id="share-button" class="mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-icon-button mat-mdc-button-base mat-mdc-tooltip-trigger share-button icon-button on-hover-button mat-unthemed ng-star-inserted" mat-ripple-loader-uninitialized="" mat-ripple-loader-class-name="mat-mdc-button-ripple" mat-ripple-loader-centered="" aria-label="이미지 공유"><span class="mat