tent-ng-c3887673081="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c3887673081-678 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted">Gemini의 응답</h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c2756684661="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts contains-extensions-response processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c155512926="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c155512926="" _nghost-ng-c3553714228="" id="message-content-id-r_ccd2c869f9680816" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3553714228="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_ccd2c869f9680816" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">제공해주신 KG ICT 로고의 색상과 형태를 영감으로 삼아, 현대적이고 세련된 아이덴티티 이미지를 새롭게 만들어보았습니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">원본 로고의 기하학적 마크를 정교하게 렌더링하고, 노란색, 주황색, 마젠타색, 그리고 보라색의 색상 팔레트를 핵심 디자인 요소로 활용했습니다. 이 색상들은 로고 마크를 결정체 형태로 묘사하는 데 사용되었으며, 주변으로 뻗어 나가는 현대적인 데이터 네트워크 궤적과 포인트에도 적용되어 "ICT" 테마를 강조합니다. 텍스트는 원본의 스타일을 유지하면서도 더 세련된 빛 효과를 추가했습니다.</p><p data-path-to-node="2"><span data-path-to-node="2,0">이 새로운 이미지가 귀사의 아이덴티티를 더욱 돋보이게 하는 데 도움이 되기를 바랍니다!</span><span data-path-to-node="2,1"><div class="attachment-container generated-images"><response-element class="" ng-version="0.0.0-PLACEHOLDER"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><generated-image _nghost-ng-c792293294="" class="ng-star-inserted" style="aspect-ratio: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c792293294="" class="loader"></div><!----><single-image _ngcontent-ng-c792293294="" class="generated-image large" _nghost-ng-c2180439729="" jslog="185864;track:generic_click,impression,attention;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_ccd2c869f9680816&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_e97bf04f4038bea0&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true" data-is-interactive="false" data-hveid="0" decode-data-ved="1" data-ved="0CAAQiKwLahgKEwjk7q6Qr6iUAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ_gY" data-image-attachment-index="0"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2180439729="" replace-fife-images-at-export="" class="image-container replace-fife-images-at-export ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2180439729="" class="overlay-container ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c2180439729="" class="image-button ng-star-inserted" jslog="181501;track:generic_click,impression;BardVeMetadataKey:[[&quot;r_ccd2c869f9680816&quot;,&quot;c_f64d2bbd82481a33&quot;,null,&quot;rc_e97bf04f4038bea0&quot;,null,null,&quot;ko&quot;,null,1,null,null,1,0]];mutable:true"><img _ngcontent-ng-c2180439729="" loading="lazy" class="image loaded" alt=", AI로 생성" src="blob:https://gemini.google.com/b435a01d-f39b-4010-99d5-5712ad162234"></button><!----><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c792293294="" overlay="" hide-from-message-actions="" class="generated-image-controls hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted"><share-button _ngcontent-ng-c792293294="" iconsize="small" icontype="translucent" class="action-button ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c4279691799="" jslog="187605;track:generic_click,impression;mutable:true"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c4279691799="" mat-icon-button="" data-test-id="share-button" class="md